('hatch','33564831','Phone carrying and time to pregnancy','Human cohort','Fertility','751 Danish and 2,349 North American men','Self-reported phone location; prospective pregnancy follow-up','Mixed findings','Little overall association was observed between front-pocket carrying and fecundability; a leaner subgroup showed lower fecundability.','Any front-pocket carrying: FR 0.94 (95% CI 0.83–1.05).','Self-reported carrying is an imprecise RF measure. Residual confounding and subgroup findings require caution.','fertility'),
